.TH parsec-cli-tos 1  "tos " 
.SH NAME
parsec\-cli\-tos \- Contains subcommands related to Term of Service (TOS)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBparsec\-cli tos\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Contains subcommands related to Term of Service (TOS)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
parsec\-cli\-tos\-list(1)
List available Terms of Service of an organization
.TP
parsec\-cli\-tos\-config(1)
Configure TOS for an organization
.TP
parsec\-cli\-tos\-accept(1)
Accept Terms of Service of an organization
.TP
parsec\-cli\-tos\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
